>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1112\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1112\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker62","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=111597\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=111597\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker63","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=118957\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=118957\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker64","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1403\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1403\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker65","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=155\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=155\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker66","name":"Zeurdalim Monster","legend":"Locals say a relic monster of 5 m long inhabits Zeurdalim Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker67","name":"Thethers Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 10 m long."},{"id":"marker68","name":"Grantleso Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 41 m long."},{"id":"marker69","name":"Watham Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 10 m long."},{"id":"marker70","name":"Hitcham Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 38 m long."},{"id":"marker71","name":"Shifton Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 27 m long."},{"id":"marker72","name":"Emnos Undead","legend":"Tales speak of a superior Undead who inhabits Emnos hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker73","name":"Eurion Ghoul","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a hungry Ghoul who inhabits Eurion hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker74","name":"Doligendola Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Kalolisism."},{"id":"marker75","name":"Pithy Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Hellenicism."},{"id":"marker76","name":"Odonia Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Hellenicism."},{"id":"marker77","name":"Flonia Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Kalolisism."},{"id":"marker78","name":"Smyrta Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Dolissaras Deities."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Melioryreum Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Hellenicism."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Meraclealy Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Hellenicism."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Malvioesive Hyenas","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Flacinilutu Owls","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Syrkurevits Wolfs","legend":"A gang of mounted robbers."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Jarvi Tigers","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Haiburg Leopards","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker97","name":"Gournasme Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠸\udc04\udc10\ud802\ud802𐠈𐠏\ud802𐠠\ud802\ud802𐠛 \udc08\ud802𐠔\udc19\udc1d\udc2e\udc1c\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠩\udc15\ud802\ud802 \udc27\ud802𐠮𐠐\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠍𐠪𐠚\udc0b\ud802𐠑 \udc33\udc24𐠞𐠲\ud802  𐠼\udc1e\udc23\udc08𐠦\udc30\udc13\ud802𐠗\udc21𐠷\ud802\ud802𐠥</div>"},{"id":"marker98","name":"Frewaldkirch Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡆᠳᡠᡎᠰᡍᠦᡍᢏᢛᠪᢀᡟᢥᡎᢠᠭᡑᢐᢡᡍᢓᠪᡴᡑᡯᡲᡖᡝᢀᡐᠮᠮᠯᠰᠵᡱᡭᡡᠨᠲᠿᢐᡁᡠᠡᡀᡟᢑᡠᠱᢢᠠᡰᢓᠨᡁᠻᢋ᠑ᢠᢠᠩᢐᠿᡖᠼᡒᠭᠧᡰᡱᠯᡔᠳᡖ</div>"},{"id":"marker99","name":"Gola Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፈፈጸቀአመጰነ ጸዘሰ ረጸነደወፀነአሀ ፀጠሰሰሀፈ የፐጠፐፀፈረቀየመገአየጰጰፀረፐሰፀ ነረፐጰ አአዐአ አ  ሐጠረገሀ</div>"},{"id":"marker100","name":"Steiltach Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1e𐠲\udc0d\udc13\udc23𐠠\udc27𐠤 \udc1e𐠿\udc12 \udc14\ud802𐠪 \udc2c𐠰\udc20\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠷\udc2d\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc08𐠩</div>"},{"id":"marker101","name":"Hattiaisa Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༸༨༩༺༧༸༬༨༇༔༜༇༪༰༆༺༮༆༥༓༔༃༨༁༄༸༆༯༘༓༔༨༲༩༓༶༰༰༫༷༁༣༮༾༃༪༑༈༥༸༩༔༬༼༲༲༐༑༲</div>"},{"id":"marker102","name":"Silipopos Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༮༫༕༿༓༦༌༴༩༡༭༤༊༽༑༸༉༈༱༬༐༼༴༔༱༻༖༪༛༕༲་་༫༌༣༾༛༜༳༫༬༌༖༪༫༾༺་༬༬༑༾༜༵༔༳༇༑༔༵༵༫༛༬༶༂༗༯༈༈༢༑༆༜༑༗༈</div>"},{"id":"marker103","name":"Lautach Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲸⳢ Ⳣ⳩ⳈⳫⳠ⳩ⳤ⳩ⳞⳎ⳹ⳎⲸⳫ ⳫⳬⳔⳒ ⳥ⲲⳂⲲⳔⳌⲼⳫ⳧⳹ⳆⳆⳭⳃⲺⲲⳫ⳾Ⳝ</div>"},{"id":"marker104","name":"Lauserngen Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳚⳞⳭ⳾Ⳏ ⳞⲼⳬⳄ⳹ⳆⳎⳖⲺⳚⳊⳤⳒⳤⲸⳃⳬⳢ⳩ⳭⳃⳖⲾⲺⳫⳔⳘⲴ⳧⳪ⳔⳖⳂ⳥ⳘⳘⳃⳐⳎ⳾ⳁ⳹ⲲⳂⳃⳊ</div>"},{"id":"marker105","name":"Hyeiapo Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ረአ ነኀገተ ጰፐወጠአጠወረዐደገዐገአአገለረበየተጸሠወአተደሠኀዘዐ ጸዐጰኀሀነቀፀ አመደጰሠወ የሠበየተወከሐኀቀቀአሰ</div>"},{"id":"marker106","name":"Siraratrea Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ኀጰኀጸነሐነረፐነ ጰሀነፐፐረሀጸጸደለሀገቀፀየ ነወቀረሠሐቀመፈከሰተሐከጰጠሰሀጸኀ ሀፐሀወጰጸደአዘቀጰ ነኀለዐበበዐፈተ ወአረከቀረለተጸመ ሐአመየተመበኀ</div>"},{"id":"marker107","name":"Paphossama Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳃ⳾ⳬⳤⳚ⳧ ⳀⲼⳲ⳩ⳀⲴ⳪⳪ⳖⳈⳖⳬⳠⳊⳢⳐⳖⳞⳃⲺⳖⳭⳜⳔⳖⳬⳊⳐⳭⳭⳐⲾ ⳖⳠⳫⳊ⳾ⳲⳤⳄ Ⳇ⳧Ⳓ</div>"},{"id":"marker108","name":"Ditadaion Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳁ⳩ ⳧ⲸⳈⲼⳢ ⳥ⳬⲸⳫ⳥Ⳉ ⳖⳫⳒⳘⳭⲸⳆⲼ  Ⳉ ⳲⳃⳌ⳪ ⳤⲾⳤⳲ ⳩ⳃⳘⲶⳒⳀⲼⳜⳜⳚⲴⳔ ⳧</div>"},{"id":"marker109","name":"Schonen Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠅\udc03𐠅 \ud802𐠊\ud802\ud802𐠿\udc11\udc21\udc33\udc31𐠸\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠰\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠣\udc16\ud802𐠵\ud802𐠫𐠴\ud802𐠨\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠓\udc2c\udc32\udc14\udc1c\udc12\udc23\udc33\ud802𐠍\udc11\udc05\udc21𐠊\udc35\udc22\ud802\ud802 𐠼\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠔\ud802𐠿\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker110","name":"Kuutavova Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡳᡒ᠑ᡙᠰᢀᠧᠪᠪᢋᡞᢁᢥᡞᡀᡆᠿᡖᢋᠽᢥᡎᡳᠧᠭᢛᠮᠻᠪᡱᠮᠽᡙᡯᠻᢀᢁᡠᠱᡏᡁᢠᡒᡞᢓᡖᠨᡜᢓᠯᢒᢦᠱᠠᢑᠦᠪ</div>"},{"id":"marker111","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker112","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker113","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker114","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker115","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker116","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker117","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker118","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker119","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker120","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker121","name":"Ruined Castle","legend":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker122","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker123","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker124","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker125","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker126","name":"Thyreumpia Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker127","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker128","name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker129","name":"Travelling Magical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker130","name":"Travelling Wondrous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this wondrous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker131","name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker132","name":"Tuukkalahai Tournament","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a tournament of cunning in Tuukkalahai, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker133","name":"Agnerilipha Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Agnerilipha, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker134","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Gola River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker135","name":"Owls migration","legend":"A huge group of owls are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker136","name":"Crocodiles migration","legend":"A huge group of crocodiles are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker137","name":"Owls migration","legend":"A huge group of owls are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker138","name":"Laiontico dance","legend":"A dance has been organised at Laiontico as a chance to gather the suspected revolutionaries of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"id":"marker139","name":"Distant mirage","legend":"This distant mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker140","name":"Diaphanous mirage","legend":"This diaphanous mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker141","name":"Distant mirage","legend":"This distant mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker142","name":"Illusory mirage","legend":"This illusory mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker143","name":"Illusory mirage","legend":"This illusory mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker144","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker145","name":"Illusory mirage","legend":"This illusory mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker146","name":"Lapamai Fracture","legend":"The Lapamai Fracture. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"id":"marker147","name":"Varvi Pit","legend":"The Varvi Pit. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"id":"marker148","name":"Vatriaras Tomb","legend":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"id":"marker149","name":"Chalaletos Mausoleum","legend":"A labyrinthine necropolis where each step echoes with haunting murmurs. The walls are adorned with ancient runes, and restless spirits guide or hinder those who dare to delve into its depths."},{"id":"marker150","name":"Taveham Necropolis","legend":"A desolate necropolis where an eerie stillness reigns. Time seems frozen amidst the decaying mausoleums, and the silence is broken only by the whispers of the wind and the rustle of tattered banners."},{"id":"marker151","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/21101\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker152","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/19327\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker153","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4021\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker154","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/20086\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-sa