cel.app/encounter/9857\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker179","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/446\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker181","name":"Sortis Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሠተቀዐበየለሀፀዘገመሀዘሰነ ተከሰዘዐተጰቀሀለ ቀሠገፐቀገ ቀሰ ወየተ ፈ ሰጰገዐፀደጠፐሀወወሐጸሀፐኀገረነጸደጸዐለለዘ ዘገየወሐ ጸጰ ጰቀሰዘከደለዘቀየፐሀ</div>"},{"id":"marker182","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker183","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker184","name":"Athmodotime Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc03\ud802\ud802 \udc25\ud802 \ud802𐠔\ud802 \ud802𐠡\ud802𐠜\ud802\ud802𐠏\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠥\udc08\udc12𐠣𐠑𐠌\udc38𐠫\ud802\ud802 \udc17\udc38\udc0e\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠪\udc16\ud802\ud802𐠛\udc27𐠵\ud802\ud802𐠷\udc35\udc1b\udc22 \udc31\udc2e\udc05\udc08𐠏\udc2f\udc23\ud802𐠔\ud802 \udc1d \ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker185","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=122473\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=122473\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker186","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker187","name":"Asktas Necropolis","legend":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal spires cast ominous shadows, concealing forbidden knowledge and arcane secrets."},{"id":"marker188","name":"Ephatis Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡒᢂᢁᢁᢤᠪ᠒ᠩᢋᠠᡰᡒᠽᠯᢒᢓᠦᡑᡝᡆᢋᡆᡲᠽᢜᠯᡎᢠ᠀ᡠᡞᡲᢞᢠᡮᡡᠪᡯ᠑ᡓᢑᡀᢜᡯᡕᢁᡝᠾᢡᢂᡔᡏᡏᡑᠰᡑᠪᡳᢛᠠᠱᢜᢑᠩ᠀ᢢᡆᡁᡕᢁᢒᠽᠵᢛᢐᠾᡡᠩᠡᠦᡟᠧᢜᡎᢡᡔᢑᠩᡏᡏᡐᠱᢏ</div>"},{"id":"marker189","name":"Petonwich Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༰༗༶༤༬༵༁༰༿༸༤༱༭༻༲༘༲༒༔༽༢༹༫༶༭༶༩༳༮༺༊༯༫༲༃༫༶༇༊་༇༸་༹༘༷༤༈༁༐༈༱༳༪༩༿༁༯༢</div>"},{"id":"marker190","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker191","name":"Disturbed Burial","legend":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"id":"marker192","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker193","name":"Mubea Cave","legend":"The Mubea Cave. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"id":"marker194","name":"Oles Necropolis","legend":"A labyrinthine necropolis where each step echoes with haunting murmurs. The walls are adorned with ancient runes, and restless spirits guide or hinder those who dare to delve into its depths."},{"id":"marker195","name":"Disturbed Burial","legend":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"id":"marker196","name":"Disturbed Burial","legend":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"id":"marker197","name":"Thaspon Crypt","legend":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal spires cast ominous shadows, concealing forbidden knowledge and arcane secrets."},{"id":"marker199","name":"Disturbed Burial","legend":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"id":"marker201","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker202","name":"Diontion Cemetery","legend":"A labyrinthine necropolis where each step echoes with haunting murmurs. The walls are adorned with ancient runes, and restless spirits guide or hinder those who dare to delve into its depths."},{"id":"marker203","name":"Ancient Rift","legend":"A rumoured ancient rift in this area is causing cracks in reality itself to form."},{"id":"marker204","name":"Laoporina Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Zalarasan Conquest. \r\nDate: December 5, 389 Altondal Era."},{"id":"marker205","name":"Theolis Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Zalarasan Conquest. \r\nDate: April 19, 389 Altondal Era."},{"id":"marker206","name":"Beiziaia Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠮᠩᡝᡠᠵᡔᢋᡗᠻ᠀ᢜᡔᢠᠵᢢᡐᢢᢥᢀᢥᡓᡗᡮᠳᠰᢞᢛᡯᢑᢂᡓᠰᡑᠵᡱ᠒ᠱᡐᠿᡠᢀᢏᢠᠭ᠐ᠡᡒᡴᠨᡜᡐᢟᢀᠼᠾᠰᡭᢛᢡᡁ᠒ᡕᡡᢥᠩᠯ᠑ᡯᡐᡠᡑᠻᠠᡯᠼᡜᢓᢜᠨᢑᡠᢁᡁᠱᢠᢁ</div>"},{"id":"regiment1-0","name":"1st (Zhenan Guo) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 287 Altondal Era during the Dunumian Campaign. 1st (Zhenan Guo) Regiment is stationed in Zhenan Guo County. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 415 AE:\r\n— infantry: 935\r\n— cavalry: 149\r\n— archers: 562\r\n— artillery: 8."},{"id":"regiment1-1","name":"2nd (Xingwuai) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 152 Altondal Era during the Arcydonese Crusade. 2nd (Xingwuai) Regiment is stationed in Xingwuai County. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 415 AE:\r\n— infantry: 846\r\n— cavalry: 83\r\n— archers: 520\r\n— artillery: 4."},{"id":"regiment1-2","name":"3rd (Xian) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 287 Altondal Era during the Dunumian Campaign. 3rd (Xian) Regiment is stationed in Taihua. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 415 